# Dependencies for the api_app lane only -- deliberately NOT folded into
# tests/unit/requirements.in.
#
# This lane runs in its own pytest invocation because it imports the API's `app` package, and
# `tests/unit/ui/conftest.py` relies on `import app` resolving uniquely to `src/ui/app`. Keeping
# the pins separate too means the main unit suite's install is unchanged: a runner that never
# invokes this lane never installs these.
#
# Versions match src/api/requirements.in so the tests run what the API ships.
https://github.com/eclipse-biscuit/biscuit-python/archive/c0fa69824a3e601da86cf5cecde09f75ea8df4d7.zip#egg=biscuit-python # 0.4.1
